node_modules/
# Anchored to this directory on purpose. A bare `data/` matches at ANY depth
# and silently swallowed src/data/*.js - the gateway, SQLite store and demo
# dataset - which made every fresh clone (and the Render deploy) die on boot
# with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND. The leading slash keeps ignoring the runtime
# database folder while letting the source code through.
/data/
.env
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
